{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL092ZXIlMjBIZXIlMjBEZWFkJTIwQm9keSUyMCUyODIwMDglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Over Her Dead Body","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/85moNqAncGlJXEwt4Ja3DfNbiQY.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xyE226IdU7ydSb1MxhsVPAqHr61.jpg","description":"After his fiancée, Kate, dies in an accident on their wedding day, veterinarian Henry grows depressed. To help him move on, his sister has him visit psychic Ashley and gives her Kate's diary. Ashley uses the journal's details to convincingly deliver the fake message that Kate wants Henry to move on. However, Kate's ghost is watching over Ashley and Henry. Furious when they fall for each other, she vows to sabotage their relationship.","releaseInfo":"2008","genres":["Comedy","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.5","runtime":"95 min","cast":["Eva Longoria","Paul Rudd","Lake Bell","Jason Biggs","Lindsay Sloane","Stephen Root","William Morgan Sheppard","Wendi McLendon-Covey"],"director":["Jeff Lowell"],"released":"2008-02-01T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"She's passed on... But she's not moving on.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Eva Longoria","character":"Kate Spencer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1u26GLWK1DE7gBugyI9P3OMFq4A.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Rudd","character":"Henry Mills","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6jtwNOLKy0LdsRAKwZqgYMAfd5n.jpg"},{"name":"Lake Bell","character":"Ashley","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sITVdq39jtR1l3VohWYDyxorx1v.jpg"},{"name":"Jason Biggs","character":"Dan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3nRgOQylYbNuDiddtNoh8uWTz5P.jpg"},{"name":"Lindsay Sloane","character":"Chloe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sbUraumaXThpJ6ewhLuxWNn0dOf.jpg"},{"name":"Stephen Root","character":"Sculptor","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2Zwi6AydqQQ9InVdhjYcfJXNzkp.jpg"},{"name":"William Morgan Sheppard","character":"Father Marks","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pg6ru